                                                "sense_id": "5f9bee4b-3cdf-314a-9883-80615ac1c4fd",
                                                "text": "It was a result that owed a lot to a moment of guile from Ramires but more to a display of guts from the Brazilian and his team-mates after Terry's needless dismissal eight minutes before half-time for driving a knee into the back of Alexis Sanchez off the ball."
                                            },
